@WP_requests "Required" here is a card heading. It labels the "Required" card inside the Run GitLab Duo agents on this project section in Settings › General › GitLab Duo. It's followed by the subtitle "Agents cannot run here until everything below is in place.", so the sense is "required prerequisites / requirements that must be met before Duo agents can run on the project."

It's not an adjective tied to a specific noun, so please translate it as a standalone heading meaning mandatory items / requirements, and feel free to add a noun (e.g. "Required settings" / "Requirements") if that reads more naturally in your language.

Hope this helps!

