@WP_requests The text "custom_roles licensed feature must be available" appears as an error message in the GraphQL API response when attempting to create an LDAP admin role link without having the custom_roles licensed feature available.
This message is not part of the regular UI that users interact with directly. It's an API error response that would be shown to developers or systems integrating with GitLab's GraphQL API when they try to use the ldapAdminRoleLinkCreate mutation without the required license.
From a translation perspective, this is a technical error message that would be returned in API responses. Do not translate custom_roles. Use a determiner if necessary, like [the feature called custom_roles].  cc @victoriaovando

